<title>USA: Pages to pay $750,000 U.S. tax settlement.</title>
<headline>Pages to pay $750,000 U.S. tax settlement.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pages Inc said on Monday it will pay $750,000 to the Internal Revenue Service to settle four Notices of Deficiencies.</p>
<p>The company said the settlement, which will be paid immediately, will not adversely affect earnings because it will be charged against previously established reserves.</p>
</text>
